==============================================================================
Kitodock is an independent implementation. Its architecture and behavior
take LaraEnv (https://github.com/thayronarrais/laraenv) as a reference —
what problems exist, what behaviors users expect — but no LaraEnv source
code is included in this repository. An automated line-level audit covering
every Go/TypeScript/CSS source file is described in
docs/progress/fase-0.md; residual identical lines are import statements,
third-party API call shapes and single-line language idioms, with zero
identical comment or prose lines.

The default theme palette is derived from the reference application's
visual design; replace it with original artwork before any public release
(see docs/05-risiko-dan-licensing.md).

